{
  "lessonId": "L2M2L1",
  "title": "Marche 馬爾凱",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a085 0%,#1abc9c 100%)'><h1>🌊 Marche</h1><p class='subtitle'>Verdicchio 的家鄉與 Adriatic 海岸</p></section><section class='slide map-slide'><div class='map-slide-container'><div id='marche-map' class='marche-region-map'></div><div class='map-legend'><h3 style='margin:0 0 20px;color:#16a085;font-size:1.4rem;border-bottom:3px solid #16a085;padding-bottom:10px;'>📍 Marche 產區地圖</h3><div class='legend-section'><h4 style='margin:15px 0 10px;color:#f8f9fa;font-size:1.1rem;'>大區邊界</h4><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;border:3px solid #16a085;margin-right:10px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;'>Marche 大區</span></div></div><div class='legend-section'><h4 style='margin:15px 0 10px;color:#f8f9fa;font-size:1.1rem;'>Verdicchio 白酒 🍾</h4><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#f39c12;margin-right:10px;border-radius:3px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;font-weight:600;'>S級</span><span style='color:#bdc3c7;margin-left:10px;font-size:0.9rem;'>Castelli di Jesi Verdicchio Riserva DOCG</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#9b59b6;margin-right:10px;border-radius:3px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;font-weight:600;'>A級</span><span style='color:#bdc3c7;margin-left:10px;font-size:0.9rem;'>Verdicchio di Matelica Riserva DOCG</span></div></div><div class='legend-section'><h4 style='margin:15px 0 10px;color:#f8f9fa;font-size:1.1rem;'>紅酒 🍷</h4><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#e74c3c;margin-right:10px;border-radius:3px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;font-weight:600;'>A級</span><span style='color:#bdc3c7;margin-left:10px;font-size:0.9rem;'>Cònero DOCG (Montepulciano)</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#e67e22;margin-right:10px;border-radius:3px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;font-weight:600;'>B級</span><span style='color:#bdc3c7;margin-left:10px;font-size:0.9rem;'>Rosso Piceno DOC</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#e91e63;margin-right:10px;border-radius:3px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;font-weight:600;'>B級</span><span style='color:#bdc3c7;margin-left:10px;font-size:0.9rem;'>Lacrima di Morro d'Alba DOC</span></div></div><div class='legend-section'><h4 style='margin:15px 0 10px;color:#f8f9fa;font-size:1.1rem;'>其他白酒 ⚪</h4><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#3498db;margin-right:10px;border-radius:3px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;font-weight:600;'>B級</span><span style='color:#bdc3c7;margin-left:10px;font-size:0.9rem;'>Offida DOCG (Pecorino/Passerina)</span></div></div><div class='legend-section'><h4 style='margin:15px 0 10px;color:#f8f9fa;font-size:1.1rem;'>重要城市</h4><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:12px;height:12px;background:#16a085;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid white;margin-right:10px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;'>Ancona, Jesi, Matelica, Ascoli Piceno</span></div></div><div class='legend-section'><h4 style='margin:15px 0 10px;color:#f8f9fa;font-size:1.1rem;'>操作提示</h4><p style='color:#bdc3c7;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin:5px 0;'>• 滑鼠懸停查看產區名稱</p><p style='color:#bdc3c7;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin:5px 0;'>• 點擊產區查看詳細資訊</p><p style='color:#bdc3c7;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin:5px 0;'>• 點擊城市標記查看說明</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🗺️ 義大利中部的隱藏寶石</h2><div class='region-intro'><div class='intro-text'><p>Marche（馬爾凱）位於義大利中部東海岸，面對 <strong>Adriatic 海</strong>，以<strong>Verdicchio 白葡萄品種</strong>和<strong>高品質紅酒 Rosso Conero</strong> 聞名。</p><p class='highlight'>Marche 的葡萄酒產業雖然不如 Tuscany 或 Piedmont 知名，但品質優異，性價比極高。</p></div><div class='marche-stats'><div class='stat-box'><div class='stat-num'>80%</div><div class='stat-label'>白葡萄酒產量</div></div><div class='stat-box'><div class='stat-num'>20%</div><div class='stat-label'>紅葡萄酒產量</div></div><div class='stat-box'><div class='stat-num'>2</div><div class='stat-label'>DOCG 產區</div></div><div class='stat-box'><div class='stat-num'>15</div><div class='stat-label'>DOC 產區</div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 Verdicchio - Marche 之星</h2><div class='verdicchio-section'><div class='verdicchio-intro'><h3>🌟 被低估的義大利白葡萄品種</h3><p>Verdicchio（小綠葡萄）是 Marche 的代表品種，能釀造<strong>清爽易飲的年輕酒</strong>，也能<strong>陳年發展出複雜度</strong>，被稱為「義大利的 Chardonnay」。</p></div><div class='verdicchio-docgs'><div class='docg-card castelli'><h4>Verdicchio dei Castelli di Jesi DOCG</h4><div class='docg-info'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Jesi 鎮周圍</p><p><strong>產量：</strong>Marche 最大產區</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>清爽、礦物感、杏仁香氣</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>檸檬、青蘋果、白花、杏仁、海洋礦物</p><p><strong>類型：</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Classico：</strong>核心產區，品質更高</li><li><strong>Riserva：</strong>陳年 18 個月（含 6 個月瓶中），13% 酒精度</li></ul></div></div><div class='docg-card matelica'><h4>Verdicchio di Matelica DOCG</h4><div class='docg-info'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Matelica 山谷（內陸、海拔更高）</p><p><strong>產量：</strong>較小、更精品化</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>結構更強、酸度更高、陳年潛力更佳</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>白桃、檸檬皮、杏仁、濕石頭、草本</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>海拔高、日夜溫差大 → 更高酸度、更濃縮風味</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Rosso Conero & Rosso Piceno</h2><div class='red-wines-section'><div class='red-wine-card conero'><h3>Rosso Conero DOC / DOCG</h3><div class='wine-info'><p class='wine-badge docg'>Conero Riserva DOCG</p><p><strong>位置：</strong>Conero 山周圍（Adriatic 海岸）</p><p><strong>品種：</strong>Montepulciano（85%+），可混 Sangiovese</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>濃郁、果香豐富、單寧柔順</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>黑櫻桃、李子、香料、香草、皮革</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>Montepulciano 在這裡表現極佳，不同於 Abruzzo 的版本</p><p><strong>Riserva：</strong>陳年 24 個月，13% 酒精度</p></div></div><div class='red-wine-card piceno'><h3>Rosso Piceno DOC</h3><div class='wine-info'><p class='wine-badge doc'>DOC</p><p><strong>位置：</strong>Marche 全區</p><p><strong>品種：</strong>Sangiovese（35-85%) + Montepulciano（15-50%）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>中等酒體、易飲、果香</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>紅櫻桃、莓果、草本、香料</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>Marche 的日常紅酒，性價比高</p><p><strong>Superiore：</strong>來自特定子產區，品質更高</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>📚 Verdicchio 陳年潛力</h2><div class='aging-section'><div class='aging-intro'><h3>🍾 不只是年輕易飲的白酒</h3><p>Verdicchio 被稱為<strong>「義大利最能陳年的白酒之一」</strong>，頂級的 Riserva 可陳年 10-20 年。</p></div><div class='aging-timeline'><div class='timeline-card young'><h4>⏳ 1-3 年</h4><div class='stage-desc'><p><strong>風格：</strong>清爽、果香主導</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>檸檬、青蘋果、白花、杏仁</p><p><strong>酸度：</strong>明顯、清新</p></div></div><div class='timeline-card mid'><h4>⏳ 4-7 年</h4><div class='stage-desc'><p><strong>風格：</strong>發展出複雜度</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>蜂蜜、堅果、乾花、礦物感增強</p><p><strong>酸度：</strong>整合良好</p></div></div><div class='timeline-card mature'><h4>⏳ 8-20 年</h4><div class='stage-desc'><p><strong>風格：</strong>複雜、優雅、有深度</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>石油氣息（類似 Riesling）、蜂蜜、乾果、礦物質</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>只有頂級的 Riserva 能達到此階段</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 其他值得注意的品種</h2><div class='other-varieties'><div class='variety-card'><h3>⚪ Pecorino</h3><p class='variety-desc'>近年崛起的白葡萄品種（名字來自羊 Pecora，因羊喜歡吃）</p><div class='variety-info'><p><strong>風格：</strong>芳香、果香豐富、酒體飽滿</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>白桃、杏桃、柑橘、白花、草本</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>比 Verdicchio 更芳香、更圓潤</p></div></div><div class='variety-card'><h3>⚪ Passerina</h3><p class='variety-desc'>傳統品種，近年重獲重視</p><div class='variety-info'><p><strong>風格：</strong>清爽、花香、礦物感</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>白花、柑橘、杏仁、礦物</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>適合釀造氣泡酒和靜態酒</p></div></div><div class='variety-card'><h3>🔴 Lacrima di Morro d'Alba DOC</h3><p class='variety-desc'>極具香氣的紅葡萄品種</p><div class='variety-info'><p><strong>風格：</strong>芳香濃郁、果香爆炸、酒體輕至中等</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>紫羅蘭、玫瑰、黑櫻桃、覆盆莓、香料</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>義大利最芳香的紅葡萄品種之一</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍽️ Marche 美食與配餐</h2><div class='food-section'><div class='marche-cuisine'><h3>🌊 Adriatic 海鮮料理</h3><p>Marche 面對 Adriatic 海，以新鮮海鮮聞名，<strong>Brodetto（馬爾凱魚湯）</strong>是代表性料理。</p></div><div class='pairing-grid'><div class='pairing-card'><h4>Verdicchio 配餐</h4><ul><li>🐟 Brodetto（馬爾凱魚湯）</li><li>🦐 炸海鮮 Fritto Misto</li><li>🍝 Spaghetti alle Vongole（蛤蜊義大利麵）</li><li>🧀 Pecorino 羊奶起司</li><li>🍗 白肉、雞肉料理</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-card'><h4>Rosso Conero 配餐</h4><ul><li>🥩 烤紅肉</li><li>🍖 Porchetta（義式烤乳豬）</li><li>🍝 肉醬義大利麵</li><li>🧀 陳年起司</li><li>🍄 野菇料理</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-card'><h4>Lacrima di Morro d'Alba 配餐</h4><ul><li>🥗 沙拉</li><li>🐟 烤魚</li><li>🍗 香料雞肉</li><li>🧀 新鮮起司</li><li>🌿 草本料理</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Marche 以 Verdicchio 白酒聞名，被稱為「義大利的 Chardonnay」</div><div class='point'>✓ Verdicchio dei Castelli di Jesi 和 Verdicchio di Matelica 是兩大 DOCG</div><div class='point'>✓ Verdicchio 能陳年 10-20 年，發展出蜂蜜、堅果、石油氣息</div><div class='point'>✓ Rosso Conero（Montepulciano 主導）是高品質紅酒</div><div class='point'>✓ Pecorino、Passerina 是新興的優質白葡萄品種</div><div class='point'>✓ Lacrima di Morro d'Alba 是義大利最芳香的紅葡萄品種之一</div></div></section></div><style>.region-intro{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.intro-text{margin-bottom:25px}.intro-text p{font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;margin:0 0 15px}.highlight{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d1f2eb,#a3e4d7);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #16a085;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}.marche-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px}.stat-box{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1abc9c,#16a085);padding:25px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}.stat-num{font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px}.stat-label{font-size:.95rem;opacity:.95}.verdicchio-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.verdicchio-intro{text-align:center;margin-bottom:25px;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d1f2eb,#eafaf1);border-radius:10px}.verdicchio-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#16a085;font-size:1.4rem}.verdicchio-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.verdicchio-docgs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px}.docg-card{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-top:6px solid}.docg-card.castelli{border-color:#3498db}.docg-card.matelica{border-color:#9b59b6}.docg-card h4{margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.3rem}.docg-card.castelli h4{color:#3498db}.docg-card.matelica h4{color:#9b59b6}.docg-info p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.docg-info strong{color:#2c3e50}.docg-info ul{margin:10px 0;padding-left:25px;line-height:1.8}.red-wines-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px}.red-wine-card{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-top:6px solid}.red-wine-card.conero{border-color:#e74c3c}.red-wine-card.piceno{border-color:#e67e22}.red-wine-card h3{margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.3rem}.red-wine-card.conero h3{color:#e74c3c}.red-wine-card.piceno h3{color:#e67e22}.wine-badge{display:inline-block;padding:5px 15px;border-radius:20px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:15px;color:#fff}.wine-badge.docg{background:#e74c3c}.wine-badge.doc{background:#e67e22}.wine-info p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.wine-info strong{color:#2c3e50}.aging-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.aging-intro{text-align:center;margin-bottom:25px;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef5e7,#fdebd0);border-radius:10px}.aging-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#f39c12;font-size:1.4rem}.aging-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.aging-timeline{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.timeline-card{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:6px solid;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}.timeline-card.young{border-color:#3498db}.timeline-card.mid{border-color:#f39c12}.timeline-card.mature{border-color:#9b59b6}.timeline-card h4{margin:0 0 15px;text-align:center;font-size:1.2rem}.timeline-card.young h4{color:#3498db}.timeline-card.mid h4{color:#f39c12}.timeline-card.mature h4{color:#9b59b6}.stage-desc p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.stage-desc strong{color:#2c3e50}.other-varieties{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.variety-card{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-top:6px solid #16a085}.variety-card h3{margin:0 0 10px;color:#16a085;font-size:1.2rem}.variety-desc{color:#7f8c8d;font-style:italic;margin:0 0 15px;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.6}.variety-info p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.variety-info strong{color:#2c3e50}.food-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.marche-cuisine{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d6eaf8,#ebf5fb);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.marche-cuisine h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#3498db;font-size:1.3rem}.marche-cuisine p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.pairing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.pairing-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;border-top:5px solid #16a085}.pairing-card h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#16a085;font-size:1.1rem;text-align:center}.pairing-card ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:2}.pairing-card li{color:#2c3e50}.key-points{display:grid;gap:10px}.point{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d1f2eb,transparent);padding:16px 22px;border-left:4px solid #16a085;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}</style>",
  "quiz": [
    {
      "question": "Verdicchio 的兩大 DOCG 中，哪個酒體更強、陳年潛力更佳？",
      "options": [
        "Verdicchio dei Castelli di Jesi",
        "Verdicchio di Matelica",
        "都一樣",
        "兩者都不能陳年"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Verdicchio di Matelica 位於內陸山谷，海拔更高，日夜溫差大，釀出的酒酸度更高、結構更強，陳年潛力更佳。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Rosso Conero DOCG 主要使用哪個葡萄品種？",
      "options": [
        "Sangiovese",
        "Montepulciano",
        "Nebbiolo",
        "Barbera"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Rosso Conero 以 Montepulciano（85% 以上）為主，可少量混入 Sangiovese，風格濃郁、果香豐富。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Verdicchio Riserva 陳年後會發展出什麼氣息？",
      "options": [
        "巧克力",
        "咖啡",
        "石油氣息（類似 Riesling）",
        "煙燻"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "explanation": "頂級的 Verdicchio Riserva 能陳年 10-20 年，發展出蜂蜜、堅果、石油氣息，類似德國 Riesling 的陳年特徵。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Lacrima di Morro d'Alba 最大的特點是？",
      "options": [
        "高單寧",
        "極芳香（紫羅蘭、玫瑰）",
        "高酒精度",
        "能長期陳年"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Lacrima di Morro d'Alba 是義大利最芳香的紅葡萄品種之一，以濃郁的紫羅蘭、玫瑰、黑櫻桃香氣聞名。"
    }
  ]
}
